\title{spicyR: test changes in the co-localisation of cell types between groups of patients}
\description{
spicyR tests, for every pair of cell types in imaging data with the type and position of every cell, whether
their co-localisation differs between groups of patients or is associated with survival. Start with
\code{\link{spicy}()}, then \code{\link{topPairs}()}, \code{\link{signifPlot}()}, \code{\link{spicyBoxPlot}()}
and \code{\link{plotImage}()}. The vignette, \code{vignette("spicyR")}, walks through a full analysis.
